cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as follows."
type: software
title: "OpenMC Feedbacks"
abstract: >-
  An importable Python package for running transport-coupled OpenMC depletion
  calculations with optional soluble-species reactivity feedback. It supports
  concentration searches over user-defined nuclides, uncertainty-aware
  refinement, warm starts, and beginning- or estimated end-of-step keff targets.
authors:
